{
  "id": "showroom",
  "name": "Showroom",
  "description": "The footage untouched and hard cuts, the words carrying it: a phrase at a time in a dark pill, each word landing as it is said, the key word big in gold script. Lines over the close-ups rise in letter by letter under a gold rule, a soft pop as each lands, and a gold lockup to close. No zooms, no dissolves.",
  "bestFor": "A shop or showroom: someone talking, then close-ups of the product.",
